This privacy policy pertains to the Overtime app for Android.

Overtime does not collect any personal information, and it has no accounts, analytics or advertising. Nothing about you or your use of the app is sent to the developer or to any third party.

The IPTV sources you add (playlist addresses, Xtream Codes logins and guide addresses), your favourites, your watch progress and your settings are stored only on your device. The app connects only to the addresses in those sources, to load channels, guides, artwork and the streams you play. A settings export is written only to the file you choose.

Overtime does not provide any TV channels, movies or series: it plays content from the sources you add yourself.

Overtime is based on Next Player by Anil Kumar Beesetti and is published by SeveriT. Questions can be raised as an issue on the app's GitHub repository.

This privacy policy is effective as of 17 November 2026 and may be updated with future versions of the app.
